<title>USA: CNS Bancorp gets okay for stock buyback.</title>
<headline>CNS Bancorp gets okay for stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY, Mo. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNS Bancorp Inc said Friday it has received regulatory approval to repurchase up to five percent of its outstanding shares within a six month period. When, and to the extent any stock repurchase program is initiated, said the company, will depend on market conditions.</p>
</text>
